        "summary": "Convertibles here are CCDs/CCPS (or iSAFEs on CCPS): conversion is a fresh allotment — board resolution, PAS-3 to the MCA — and foreign-held instruments must be reported to the RBI (FC-GPR on the FIRMS portal) within 30 days.",
