        "kind": "analog",
        "summary": "ASAs convert at the round as a normal allotment (SH01 to Companies House) — and the conversion deadline is hard law for tax relief: S/EIS requires shares to be issued within the ASA's 6-month longstop.",
        "actionUrl": "https://www.gov.uk/guidance/venture-capital-schemes-apply-for-the-enterprise-investment-scheme",
